{"id":"bc125fa84031840f","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Test Function Space","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space — ZFC Analysis2 Test Function Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space — ZFC Analysis2 Test Function Space","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-support.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-test-function]]","[[58-df-open]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space — ZFC Analysis2 Test Function Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edc520f758b19264\" href=\"?note=edc520f758b19264\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-support.md\">../batch01/58-df-support.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"58-df-test-function\">58-df-test-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" href=\"?note=ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" title=\"58-df-open\">58-df-open</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\Omega\\in V\">\\(D,\\Omega\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2TestFunctionSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2TestFunctionSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 保留原接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> 是下式内部量化的欧氏维数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)\">\\(\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n\\upharpoonright A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_n\\}\">\\(\\tau_n\\upharpoonright A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S\\)</span> 使用内部欧氏光滑函数定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{\\leq k}=\\bigcup_{r\\leq k}n^r\">\\(n^{\\leq k}=\\bigcup_{r\\leq k}n^r\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Support}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Support}_S\\)</span> 采用实值函数、零点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的六元支集接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> 使用显式空间和拓扑的二元接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}test\\text{-}function\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\quad\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2TestFunctionSpace}_S(D,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl[\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land\nD=\\bigl\\{\\phi\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists F\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(\\phi,\\Omega),\\Omega,n,1,k)\n\\land\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),\\Omega,1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists K\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Support}_S(K,\\phi,\\Omega,\\tau_n\\upharpoonright\\Omega,\\mathbb R,0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau_n\\upharpoonright K)\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}test\\text{-}function\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\quad\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2TestFunctionSpace}_S(D,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl[\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land\nD=\\bigl\\{\\phi\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists F\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(\\phi,\\Omega),\\Omega,n,1,k)\n\\land\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),\\Omega,1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists K\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Support}_S(K,\\phi,\\Omega,\\tau_n\\upharpoonright\\Omega,\\mathbb R,0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau_n\\upharpoonright K)\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility alias for the canonical test-function space; compact support is interpreted by the upstream subspace/topological definition rather than by the unrelated two-argument compactness call.</li>\n<li>The upstream space is real-valued and is defined only for an open Euclidean domain; both facts are now preserved by the alias. Complex test functions require the explicit complexification in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c53fe47de39217ed\" href=\"?note=c53fe47de39217ed\" title=\"58-df-distribution\">58-df-distribution</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-support.md","status":"resolved","id":"edc520f758b19264","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-support.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-test-function","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-test-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-open","status":"resolved","id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-distribution","status":"resolved","id":"c53fe47de39217ed","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The upstream space is real-valued and is defined only for an open Euclidean domain; both facts are now preserved by the alias. Complex test functions require the explicit complexification in [[58-df-distribution]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\Omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2TestFunctionSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n\\upharpoonright A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"n^{\\leq k}=\\bigcup_{r\\leq k}n^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Support}_S","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}test\\text{-}function\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\quad\n&\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2TestFunctionSpace}_S(D,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl[\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land\nD=\\bigl\\{\\phi\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists F\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(\\phi,\\Omega),\\Omega,n,1,k)\n\\land\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),\\Omega,1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\exists K\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Support}_S(K,\\phi,\\Omega,\\tau_n\\upharpoonright\\Omega,\\mathbb R,0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau_n\\upharpoonright K)\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2314,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1453","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space.md|58-df-zfc-analysis2-test-function-space]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["17de8347f6f91384","edc520f758b19264","050f6d05b2c94aea","ca7fc3ab38a11801","a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","458fd0dccec3665f","ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","c53fe47de39217ed"]}